Hi Sam, that's quite all right, I usually try to split up the opening and c=
losing between two people so that you don't feel so boxed in with the hours=
.  I will ask Ron and Jacki to start closing it again.  Would you be able t=
o close it on their days off?  Their days off are Monday and Tuesday.

